WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue {
  background-color: rgba(247, 241, 227, 0.92);
  color: #28241E;
  font-family: "Lexend", "Atkinson Hyperlegible", sans-serif;
  font-size: 140%;
  font-weight: 600;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.728
This is Nibras.

00:00:01.728 --> 00:00:04.919
A calmer way to read, think, and
learn.

00:00:04.919 --> 00:00:06.720
I'm your Nibras guide.

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.642
Everything lives in one calm home.

00:00:10.642 --> 00:00:13.371
From here, you can open any tool.

00:00:13.371 --> 00:00:17.671
The Reader, Reading Techniques, Mind
Maps, and more.

00:00:17.671 --> 00:00:19.160
Pick one to begin.

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:22.899
Paste any text, or open a whole book.

00:00:22.899 --> 00:00:26.109
Nibras reshapes it to feel easy on
your eyes.

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:30.675
Choose the font, the size, and the
spacing until it feels right.

00:00:30.675 --> 00:00:33.100
Set it once, and Nibras remembers.

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:35.329
Now the colours.

00:00:35.329 --> 00:00:38.419
Choose any background colour that
feels calm.

00:00:38.419 --> 00:00:42.678
And if the words become hard to read,
Nibras gently warns you.

00:00:42.678 --> 00:00:45.150
Your choice is saved on your device.

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:50.905
Reading Buddy reads aloud in a calm
voice, so you can listen as you read.

00:00:50.905 --> 00:00:53.705
Choose the voice and the pace that
suit you.

00:00:53.705 --> 00:00:55.360
No pressure, no judgement.

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:58.490
Reading Techniques are short,

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:02.060
evidence-based tips to read, focus,
and understand.

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:03.460
Three simple groups.

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:05.630
Open any one, and press listen.

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:10.218
Mind Maps turn your ideas into a
branching picture.

00:01:10.218 --> 00:01:14.964
Explore the example, or paste your
own text and Nibras builds the map.

00:01:14.964 --> 00:01:17.540
Add notes, colour it, and download
it.

00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:22.372
Letter Sounds lets you hear the sound
each letter makes,

00:01:22.372 --> 00:01:24.692
with an example word for every one.

00:01:24.692 --> 00:01:26.150
In Arabic and English.

00:01:27.260 --> 00:01:32.260
And when you need a moment, Calmness
gives you a quiet breathing pause.

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:33.527
Breathe in slowly.

00:01:33.527 --> 00:01:34.161
Then out.

00:01:34.161 --> 00:01:35.710
Nothing here is saved.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:39.681
Tap your guide on any page to hear
more.

00:01:39.681 --> 00:01:42.602
Everything stays private, on your
device.

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:43.600
Read your way.
